    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d364-a3">

                <pb facs="0659" n="597" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg597"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">section of america.—national army, division of the
                        north, general-in-chief.—section</hi> 2, <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                    >no</hi>. 705.</head>
                <p>I have the honor to inclose to you a copy of the communication in which are given
                    the details relating to the capture of the barbarous Lipans, in order that, on
                    being informed of it, you may be pleased, in view of its contents, to decide
                    upon what you may deem proper.</p>
                <p>Liberty in the constitution.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName>Monterey</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1878-06-28">June 28, 1878</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>G. TREVIÑO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>To the citizen <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister of War and Marine</hi>,
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
